  "notes": [
    "Both Android TV and Google TV catalogs expose stable ARM64 API31,33,34,36 packages.",
    "Older API31,33,34 Intel-compatible catalog entries are x86, not x86_64. Emulator host support and native bridge support need separate tests.",
    "An arm64-v8a package tag does not prove or disprove guest armeabi-v7a compatibility. Read actual ro.product.cpu.abilist/abilist32/abilist64 after boot and install original APK.",
    "No Android images downloaded or booted; only XML catalogs and HTTP HEAD metadata were retrieved.",
    "Changing Android API may address platform/API behavior regressions, but does not itself create missing native ABI support or fix application-side null handling."
  ],
